            "unbridled rivalry",
            "social cohesion",
            "mental faculties",
            "academic pursuits",
            "Without hesitation",
            "When evaluating",
            "It becomes self-evident",
            "In my daily life",
            "From my perspective",
            "Looking ahead",
            "On the flip side",
            "First and foremost",
